Title: Night Shift
Credit: Written by
Author: Collin Longoria
Draft date: 2024

INT. DINER - NIGHT

A near-empty diner. Rain on the windows. MARA (30s) wipes the same spot on the counter for the third time.

The door opens. THEO (40s), soaked, sits at the counter.

THEO
Coffee. Whatever's been sitting longest.

MARA
(pouring)
That'd be me.

THEO
Long night?

MARA
They're all long. This one's just louder.

A crack of thunder. The lights flicker.

CUT TO:

EXT. PARKING LOT - CONTINUOUS

A single car idles, headlights on the diner window.

> THE END <
